{%- doc -%}
The CSS font-family of one of the store's own fonts (the ones in this theme's assets, not the Shopify library), by its short name. It is the family
name that sections/media-blocks.liquid declares with @font-face ("Words ..."), followed by the theme's Heading font as the fallback. Prints the value only.

@param {string} font - 'rektorat', 'swiss', 'satoshi' or 'apercu'. Anything else prints the theme's Heading font.
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  case font
    when 'rektorat'
      echo "'Words Rektorat', var(--heading-font-family)"
    when 'swiss'
      echo "'Words Swiss', var(--heading-font-family)"
    when 'satoshi'
      echo "'Words Satoshi', var(--heading-font-family)"
    when 'apercu'
      echo "'Words Apercu', var(--heading-font-family)"
    else
      echo 'var(--heading-font-family)'
  endcase
-%}
